# Project Architecture

This is a real-time chat application built with **Next.js 16 (App Router)**, **Convex** (backend/database), **React 19**, **Tailwind CSS 4**, and **TypeScript 5**.

## Enforced Folder Structure

```
online-mafia-v2/
├── app/                          # Next.js App Router (pages & layouts ONLY)
│   ├── layout.tsx                # Root layout with ConvexClientProvider
│   ├── page.tsx                  # Landing / home page
│   ├── (auth)/                   # Auth route group
│   │   ├── sign-in/page.tsx
│   │   └── sign-up/page.tsx
│   ├── chat/                     # Chat feature routes
│   │   ├── layout.tsx
│   │   ├── page.tsx              # Chat list
│   │   └── [conversationId]/     # Dynamic conversation route
│   │       └── page.tsx
│   └── globals.css               # Global styles (Tailwind)
├── components/                   # ALL React components live here
│   ├── ui/                       # Primitives: Button, Input, Avatar, Badge, etc.
│   ├── chat/                     # Chat feature components
│   ├── auth/                     # Auth feature components
│   ├── layout/                   # Sidebar, Header, MobileNav, etc.
│   └── providers/                # ConvexClientProvider, ThemeProvider, etc.
├── hooks/                        # Custom React hooks
├── lib/                          # Utilities, helpers, constants
│   ├── utils.ts                  # Generic utility functions
│   └── constants.ts              # App-wide constants
├── types/                        # Shared TypeScript types/interfaces
├── convex/                       # Convex backend (see convex rule)
│   ├── schema.ts                 # Database schema (single source of truth)
│   ├── _generated/               # Auto-generated (NEVER edit)
│   ├── messages.ts               # Message queries/mutations
│   ├── conversations.ts          # Conversation queries/mutations
│   ├── users.ts                  # User queries/mutations
│   └── lib/                      # Shared server-side helpers
├── public/                       # Static assets
└── middleware.ts                  # Root-level middleware
```

## Strict Rules

1. **No component code in `app/`** — `app/` contains ONLY `page.tsx`, `layout.tsx`, `loading.tsx`, `error.tsx`, and `not-found.tsx`. All UI components are imported from `components/`.
2. **No business logic in components** — Components render UI. Logic lives in `hooks/` or `convex/`.
3. **Feature-based grouping** — Group components by feature (`components/chat/`, `components/auth/`), not by type.
4. **One component per file** — Each file exports exactly one component as the default export.
5. **Index files for barrels** — Each feature folder in `components/` may have an `index.ts` barrel export.

## Naming Conventions

| Item | Convention | Example |
|------|-----------|---------|
| Component files | PascalCase | `MessageBubble.tsx` |
| Hook files | camelCase with `use` prefix | `useMessages.ts` |
| Utility files | camelCase | `formatDate.ts` |
| Convex functions | camelCase | `messages.ts` |
| Types/interfaces | PascalCase with no `I` prefix | `Message`, `User` |
| Constants | UPPER_SNAKE_CASE | `MAX_MESSAGE_LENGTH` |
| CSS classes | Tailwind utilities only | No custom CSS unless absolutely necessary |
| Route folders | kebab-case | `sign-in/`, `chat/` |
| Route groups | parentheses | `(auth)/` |

## Import Order (enforced)

```typescript
// 1. React/Next.js
import { useState } from "react";
import Link from "next/link";

// 2. Third-party libraries
import { useQuery } from "convex/react";

// 3. Convex API
import { api } from "@/convex/_generated/api";

// 4. Components
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/Button";

// 5. Hooks
import { useMessages } from "@/hooks/useMessages";

// 6. Utils / types / constants
import { formatDate } from "@/lib/utils";
import type { Message } from "@/types";
```

Always use the `@/` path alias. Never use relative imports that go more than one level up (`../../`).
